    "news.google-deep-review-public-release.title": "Google publicly releases Deep Review for document feedback",
    "news.google-deep-review-public-release.summary": "Deep Review launches with PDF and plain-text support and two free reviews per week, helping check technical documents for logical consistency and supporting evidence while leaving final judgment to people.",
